---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Pricing | cppMax" description="The cppMax beta is free. Read the current plan for post-beta interpreter access and envTokens.">
  <header class="pricing-hero">
    <div class="shell">
      <p class="availability">Current beta</p>
      <h1>The beta is completely free.</h1>
      <p class="hero-copy">The editor, compiler, interpreter, and current beta tools cost nothing while cppMax is in beta.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="beta-summary">
    <div class="summary-shell">
      <div class="price-mark"><strong>€0</strong><span>during beta</span></div>
      <div class="beta-details">
        <h2>Use the full beta without ads or payment.</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Editor and project tools</li>
          <li>LLVM, Clang, and LLD</li>
          <li>Git and most CMake projects</li>
          <li>Current interpreter access</li>
          <li>Unlimited runs of unchanged builds</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="monetization-section">
    <div class="content-shell">
      <p class="section-label">Planned for v1</p>
      <h2>How monetization will work.</h2>
      <div class="reasoning-grid">
        <p>cppMax uses Clang and LLD, which I did not create. Charging each time those tools compile your source would feel wrong.</p>
        <p>Charging for every run would also feel wrong. It is your program, running from your build, on your device.</p>
        <p>The custom part is the cppMax interpreter. The current plan charges once when a new build enters that interpreter, then leaves repeated runs alone.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="token-explanation">
        <div>
          <span class="token-count">1</span>
          <p>envToken for a standard program</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="token-count">2</span>
          <p>envTokens for a future graphical program</p>
        </div>
        <div class="token-result">
          <span>After entry</span>
          <p>Run that unchanged build as many times as you want.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="explanation-footnote">An envToken is the planned one-time interpreter entry for an exact build. It is not a fee for each compilation or each run.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="future-pricing">
    <div class="content-shell">
      <div class="future-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="section-label">Future pricing</p>
          <h2>Choose how to access the interpreter.</h2>
        </div>
        <p>The editor and compiler remain available without ads. Payment or ads apply only when a new build needs interpreter access.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing-grid">
        <article>
          <span class="plan-number">01</span>
          <div class="plan-price"><strong>€0</strong><span>with ads</span></div>
          <h3>Free with ads</h3>
          <p class="plan-label">No purchase required</p>
          <p>Watch an ad when you want to earn envTokens for interpreter access.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>The editor stays ad-free</li>
            <li>The compiler stays ad-free</li>
            <li>Ads are optional unless you need tokens</li>
            <li>Save tokens before going offline</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span class="plan-number">02</span>
          <div class="plan-price"><strong>€3.99</strong><span>likely monthly price</span></div>
          <h3>Monthly subscription</h3>
          <p class="plan-label">Planned paid option</p>
          <p>Use the interpreter without watching ads or managing an envToken balance.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Interpreter access is included</li>
            <li>No advertising step</li>
            <li>Connect each billing period</li>
            <li>Payment status is checked online</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span class="plan-number">03</span>
          <div class="plan-price"><strong>€?</strong><span>prepaid price</span></div>
          <h3>Prepaid subscription</h3>
          <p class="plan-label">Planned offline option</p>
          <p>Prepay a fixed period when you need long stretches without an internet connection.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Same interpreter access as monthly</li>
            <li>No advertising step</li>
            <li>Prepay up to 12 months</li>
            <li>Stay offline for the prepaid period</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="unknown-price">*No clue how much prepaid will be.</p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <p class="pricing-disclaimer">Exact prices and the envToken economy may change before release.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .pricing-hero {
    padding: clamp(82px, 11vw, 142px) 0 clamp(70px, 9vw, 112px);
    text-align: center;
    background: #f8fbff;
  }
  .availability, .section-label {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    color: #0066cc;
    font: 700 .7rem/1 ui-monospace, monospace;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .pricing-hero h1 {
    max-width: 1040px;
    margin: 0 auto 26px;
    color: #08090b;
    font-size: clamp(3.7rem, 8.5vw, 7.6rem);
    line-height: .92;
  }
  .hero-copy { max-width: 730px; margin: 0 auto; color: #53565a; font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.3rem); }
  .beta-summary { padding: 82px 24px; color: #f5f5f7; background: #242526; }
  .summary-shell {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: .8fr 1.2fr;
    gap: clamp(50px, 8vw, 120px);
    width: min(1180px, 100%);
    margin-inline: auto;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .price-mark { display: flex; align-items: end; gap: 17px; }
  .price-mark strong { font-size: clamp(6rem, 14vw, 11rem); line-height: .72; letter-spacing: -.09em; }
  .price-mark span { color: #aeb0b4; font-weight: 700; }
  .beta-details h2 { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.5vw, 4.4rem); }
  .beta-details ul { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0 28px; margin: 35px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .beta-details li { padding: 13px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #454649; color: #c7c8cb; }
  .beta-details li::before { content: '✓'; margin-right: 11px; color: #73d994; }
  .monetization-section { padding: 118px 24px; background: #f8fbff; }
  .content-shell { width: min(1180px, 100%); margin-inline: auto; }
  .monetization-section h2, .future-heading h2 { max-width: 850px; font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem); }
  .reasoning-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 40px; margin-top: 55px; padding-top: 34px; border-top: 1px solid #d9dde2; }
  .reasoning-grid p { margin: 0; color: #53565a; font-size: 1.06rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .token-explanation { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1.2fr; gap: 14px; margin-top: 74px; }
  .token-explanation > div { min-height: 190px; padding: 26px; border: 1px solid #d7dce2; border-radius: 20px; background: white; }
  .token-count { display: block; margin-bottom: 36px; color: #0066cc; font-size: 3.4rem; font-weight: 750; line-height: 1; }
  .token-explanation p { margin: 0; color: #292b2e; font-weight: 650; line-height: 1.45; }
  .token-result { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; color: white; background: #0066cc !important; }
  .token-result span { font: 700 .7rem/1 ui-monospace, monospace; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .token-result p { color: white; font-size: 1.25rem; }
  .explanation-footnote { max-width: 760px; margin: 28px 0 0; color: #686b70; font-size: .9rem; }
  .future-pricing { padding: 118px 24px; color: #f5f5f7; background: #242526; }
  .future-pricing .section-label { color: #78b8ff; }
  .future-heading { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.25fr .75fr; gap: 70px; align-items: end; }
  .future-heading h2, .future-heading > p { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .future-heading > p { color: #b7b8bc; }
  .pricing-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-top: 64px; }
  .pricing-grid article { display: flex; min-height: 500px; flex-direction: column; padding: 28px; border: 1px solid #454649; border-radius: 22px; background: #2d2e30; }
  .plan-number { margin-bottom: 65px; color: #78b8ff; font: 700 .7rem/1 ui-monospace, monospace; }
  .plan-price { display: flex; min-height: 92px; align-items: end; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .plan-price strong { color: white; font-size: clamp(3.8rem, 6vw, 5.8rem); line-height: .75; letter-spacing: -.07em; }
  .plan-price span { max-width: 92px; color: #8e9095; font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; }
  .pricing-grid h3 { margin-bottom: 14px; font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .plan-label { color: white !important; font-weight: 700; }
  .pricing-grid p { color: #b7b8bc; line-height: 1.6; }
  .pricing-grid ul { margin: auto 0 0; padding: 25px 0 0; border-top: 1px solid #454649; list-style: none; }
  .pricing-grid li { padding: 8px 0; color: #c6c7ca; font-size: .88rem; }
  .pricing-grid li::before { content: '✓'; margin-right: 10px; color: #73d994; }
  .unknown-price { margin: 18px 0 0 !important; color: #8e9095 !important; font-size: .76rem !important; }
  .pricing-disclaimer { margin: 30px 0 0; padding: 18px 20px; border: 1px solid #53555a; border-radius: 13px; color: #c6c7ca; background: #2d2e30; }

  @media (max-width: 850px) {
    .summary-shell, .future-heading { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .reasoning-grid, .pricing-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .pricing-grid article { min-height: 420px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 650px) {
    .beta-details ul, .token-explanation { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .price-mark { align-items: center; flex-direction: column; }
    .reasoning-grid { gap: 24px; }
  }
</style>
